    <string name="about_license_body">Ko Muslim he tino kore utu, tuwhera-puna taupānga i raro i te raihana GPLv3 - kaore he panui, kaore he ohaurunga, kaore he aroturuki. Ko nga putanga whakarereke ka noho tuwhera tonu.</string>
    <string name="about_license_title">Raihana</string>
