    <string name="privacy_body">Ka whakaute a Mahometa i to waahitanga me te kore e kohi i o raraunga.\n0\n• Karekau he aroturuki: karekau he ad SDK, tātaritanga me nga kaiwhaiwhai hokohoko.\n• Ka noho nga raraunga ki to taputapu: ka rongoa katoa o raraunga (tauwāhi, tautuhinga, tohuwāhi) i to rohe anake i runga i to taputapu anake. kare rawa e tukuna ki tetahi tūmau o waho.\n• Whakaaetanga anake ina hiahiatia: ka tono matou mo nga whakaaetanga (tauwāhi, whakamohiotanga) mena ka tino hiahia tetahi waahanga, me te whakamarama marama.\n• Kaore he hononga kaha: kei te mahi tuimotu te taupānga; Ko te whakamahi whatunga he mea whiriwhiri noa mo nga taapiri penei i te tango korero.\n\nKo tenei kaupapahere he waahanga o te putunga puna tuwhera ka tuwhera ki te arotake hapori.</string>
